 {
  "id": "2120448740012265621",
  "title": "Maple and birch forest at peak autumn",
  "title_zh": "深秋时节的枫树与白桦树林",
  "category": "3d-scene",
  "author": {
   "handle": "ItsmeAjayKV",
   "name": "AJ"
  },
  "postUrl": "https://x.com/ItsmeAjayKV/status/2120448740012265621",
  "createdAt": "2026-11-11T09:29:10.000Z",
  "durationMs": 95983,
  "mp4": "https://www.sandbase.ai/lab/media/x/qwen4-max/2120448740012265621/video.mp4",
  "promptShared": true,
  "promptText": "Qwen4-max-preview is great on one-shots🔥\n\nAnother one-shot result and Qwen4-max-preview again impressed me.\n\nI asked it to make a maple and birch forest at peak autumn, with trees and some nice animation, goal is to build a forest that has life to it. \n\nWithout using any external assets, all in code, no tool calls, no harness, single api call with high thinking effort. \n\nI have done the same with other models, deepseek-v4.1-flash produced the best result, until now, we have a new winner.\n\nQwen absolutely went crazy and added so many extra features, extra sound, all the controls, everything towards making this feel more whole. Nothing wasted.\n\nAnd this entire thing only needed 83,173 tokens.\n\nThis is lower than what DeepSeek-v4.1-flash-1017 required.",
  "featured": 0,
  "poster": "https://www.sandbase.ai/lab/media/x/qwen4-max/2120448740012265621/poster.jpg",
  "labUrl": "https://www.sandbase.ai/lab/ai-videos/qwen4-max/2120448740012265621"
 },
